    {
      "id": "claim_1516f4b69a4147a9bfb50e1632143b45",
      "statement": "Open-Inspect is an open-source background coding agent system inspired by Ramp's Inspect: tasks arrive from a web UI, Slack, GitHub PRs, Linear, webhooks, or scheduled automations, run in sandboxed development environments with an AI coding agent, stream back in real time, and end in commits and PRs attributed to the prompting user — three tiers (Next.js web client, Cloudflare Workers control plane with per-session Durable Objects and D1, Python sandboxes on Modal) connected by WebSockets.",
