      "id": "claim_cadc3b7c5890466a8571edf76de4bf94",
      "statement": "Open-Inspect is single-tenant only: all users are trusted members of one organization sharing a single GitHub App installation — the control plane mints short-lived installation tokens server-side and brokers them to sandboxes via the git credential helper, every user can access any repo the App is installed on, there is no per-user repository access validation at session creation, and user OAuth tokens (used for PR creation attribution) are not an isolation boundary.",
